  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is a 4-aminobenzenesulfonamide (sulfisoxazole-type) antibiotic. Multiple close structural analogues—sulfamethazine, sulfadiazine, sulfadoxine, and related isoxazole sulfonamides—show high human oral bioavailability (80-100%), providing strong transferable evidence for F >= 20%. The physicochemical prior's ionization/TPSA concerns are outweighed by these direct experimental data.",
